Koustrup","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"7f056e7e-cb87-4411-a4ef-23726cfd2794","name":"Jørgensen, Mads Koustrup","orcid":"0000-0002-4733-0395","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/j.seppur.2025.133722","issn":["13835866","18733794"],"issn_org":["13835866"],"journal":"Separation and Purification Technology","paperid":"133722","publisher":"Elsevier","status":"e","title":"Separation and Purification Technology","volume":"374"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-105006773359"],"sdg":["6. Clean Water and Sanitation","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["E-Published (ahead of print)"]},"sid":["aau-3c12c29c-efe9-433e-b5c8-f79ec2458048"],"src":["AAU Aalborg University"],"title":"Compressibility characterization of organic and inorganic fouling by the 3ω method","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-814366","year":"2025","yearsub":"2025"}
{"author_count":5,"contributors":["Isham, Aleksandra Eriksen","Watson, Lynn Ann","Bohn, Annette","Jørgensen, Carsten René","Mehlum, Lars"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-816266"],"event":{"end":"2025-06-14","place":"County Kildare, ie","start":"2025-06-11","title":"SARMAC XV","year":"2025"},"filters":{"added":"2025-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"involuntary autobiographical memories a potential vulnerability factor for the emergence of bpd during adolescence","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-816266","ids":["au-991966a3-24f6-4c5c-9466-c602a2341154"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-B0148E04801391F0FB7B946CB55D9F49"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus BSS, Department of Psychology and Behavioural Sciences, Department of Psychology and Behavioural Sciences - CON AMORE"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Aleksandra Eriksen","key":"ishampau","last":"Isham","name":"Isham, Aleksandra Eriksen","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lynn Ann","key":"watsonpau","last":"Watson","locid":"e7e4a04c-1bb5-4246-8d29-7bc86dfa1bb6","name":"Watson, Lynn Ann","orcid":"0000-0001-5150-1217","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Annette","key":"bohnpau","last":"Bohn","locid":"63156000-0ce0-4610-b068-ee3354380b04","name":"Bohn, Annette","orcid":"0000-0003-0088-5323","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Carsten René","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"3763a4db-6ce1-4e54-ac67-524a9604e1ce","name":"Jørgensen, Carsten René","orcid":"0000-0002-7324-1628","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars","key":"mehlumpau","last":"Mehlum","name":"Mehlum, Lars","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-991966a3-24f6-4c5c-9466-c602a2341154"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Involuntary autobiographical memories: a potential vulnerability factor for the emergence of BPD during adolescence?","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-816266","year":"2025","yearsub":"2025"}
{"abstract":"Roux-en-Y gastric bypass improves glycemic control in patients with type 2 diabetes, but the impact of the improved glycemic control on β-cell sensitivity to glucagon-like peptide-1 (GLP-1) and glucose-dependent insulinotropic peptide (GIP) is sparsely described. GLP-1 and GIP potentiated insulin secretion during clamped hyperglycemia before and after surgery, but, when related to the response to glucose alone, the relative potentiating effects of GIP (on first-phase insulin secretion) and GLP-1 (on first- and second-phase insulin secretion) were reduced postoperatively. The improvement in β-cell function after Roux-en-Y gastric bypass in patients with type 2 diabetes is not driven by improved β-cell sensitivity to incretins but rather other factors, including improved β-cell sensitivity to the changed glucose response and exaggerated postprandial GLP-1.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Svane, Maria S.","Hindsø, Morten","Martinussen, Christoffer","Dirksen, Carsten","Jørgensen, Nils B.","Hedbäck, Nora","Hartmann, Bolette","Kristiansen, Viggo B.","Holst, Jens Juul","Bojsen-Møller, Kirstine Nyvold","Madsbad, Sten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-829643"],"filters":{"added":"2025-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"β cell function and sensitivity to incretins before and after roux en y gastric bypass in individuals with type 000000000002 diabetes","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-829643","identifier":[{"id":"40608389","type":"pmid"},{"id":"105013885705","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-ae57198a-6203-4d5e-a5a2-4a6fe62698f7"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-F0447BBEBB96C31B4420DD100AB9B5C2"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Amager and Hvidovre"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","first":"Maria S.","key":"svanepau","last":"Svane","locid":"bf37b0fa-30de-42bc-b0c4-0bc37287cd79","name":"Svane, Maria S.","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Morten","key":"hindsøpau","last":"Hindsø","name":"Hindsø, Morten","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Christoffer","key":"martinussenpau","last":"Martinussen","name":"Martinussen, Christoffer","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 1","first":"Carsten","key":"dirksenpau","last":"Dirksen","locid":"2504d7c9-ee3f-4990-9c1b-10be728b298c","name":"Dirksen, Carsten","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 1","first":"Nils B.","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","name":"Jørgensen, Nils B.","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Nora","key":"hedbäckpau","last":"Hedbäck","name":"Hedbäck, Nora","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Bolette","key":"hartmannpau","last":"Hartmann","locid":"eb04fc6b-068a-4d5b-a106-1b7be3f7e12b","name":"Hartmann, Bolette","orcid":"0000-0001-8509-2036","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Viggo B.","key":"kristiansenpau","last":"Kristiansen","name":"Kristiansen, Viggo B.","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jens J.","key":"holstpau","last":"Holst","locid":"864b6401-9024-4773-9bdb-f4d4ca57dcad","name":"Holst, Jens Juul","name_org":"Holst, Jens J.","orcid":"0000-0001-6853-3805","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","first":"Kirstine N.","key":"bojsenmøllerpau","last":"Bojsen-Møller","locid":"a1de842f-aeb0-4687-bcc1-a5478f6f6bf0","name":"Bojsen-Møller, Kirstine Nyvold","name_org":"Bojsen-Møller, Kirstine N.","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Sten","key":"madsbadpau","last":"Madsbad","name":"Madsbad, Sten","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["40608389"],"pub":{"doi":"10.2337/db24-1054","issn":["00121797","1939327X"],"issn_org":["00121797"],"issue":"9","journal":"Diabetes","pages":"1652-1663","status":"p","title":"Diabetes","volume":"74"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-105013885705"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-ae57198a-6203-4d5e-a5a2-4a6fe62698f7"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"β-Cell Function and Sensitivity to Incretins Before and After Roux-en-Y Gastric Bypass in Individuals With Type 2 Diabetes","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-829643","year":"2025","yearsub":"2025"}
{"abstract":"Study Design. Retrospective cohort study. Objective. The purpose of the current study is to describe long-term opioid use following lumbar spine surgery and, to investigate risk factors associated with prolonged use of opioids in patients undergoing spine surgery to treat chronic pain. Summary of Background Data. During the last decade, the use of opioids in management of nonmalignant pain has been a topic of interest to surgeons and politicians worldwide with reference to the \"opioid epidemic\"in the United States. Although WHO guidelines advice against use of opioids to treat chronic low back pain in patients with degenerative spine orders, such therapy is still administered to vast numbers of patients all over the world. Materials and Methods. This is an observational study of 14,082 patients based on a nationwide database of spine surgeries (DaneSpine) during the period 2016-2022. We included patients who underwent lumbar spine surgery to treat spinal stenosis, spondylolisthesis, and disc herniation. Statistical analysis included descriptive statistics and relative risk analysis for factors associated with one-year postoperative opioid use. Results. We had available data on preoperative and postoperative use of pain medicine and opioids on 14,082 patients who underwent spine surgery due to spinal stenosis (n=7932), disc herniation (n=4573), and spondylolisthesis (n=1577). Thirty-six percent of patients were on prescription opioids before surgery, as compared with 17% of patients at 1-year follow-up after surgery (P<0.001). Overall, patients with preoperative opioid use had an increased relative risk (RR) of 4.70 (P=0.002) of being prolonged opioid users in all patient groups combined. Modifiable risk factors for prolonged postoperative opioid use included pain duration, body mass index, and smoking. Conclusion. While opioid use is diminished overall during the seven-year study period, and most patients came of opioids after surgery, we found that preoperative opioid use was the strongest predictor for prolonged postoperative use.","author_count":19,"contributors":["Andresen, Andreas K.","Carreon, Leah Y.","Bech, Rune","Bjarkam, Carsten R.","Bruun, Carsten","Caspersen, Jon","Dons, Kjeld","Jørgensen, Louise Møller","Rasmussen, Mikkel Mylius","Nielsen, Michael","Nielsen, Troels Hafeldt","Pedersen, Casper","Rickers, Kresten","Rousing, Rikke","Skov, Simon Toftgaard","Andersen, Mikkel Østerheden"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-822378"],"filters":{"added":"2025-08","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"corresponding_author":["Andresen, Andreas K."],"keyword":["Disc herniation","Lumbar spine surgery","Opioid","Spinal stenosis","Spondylolisthesis","prolonged opioid use"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"OT":["Privathospitalet Kollund"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-CDR","DI-HO-NDR","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"perioperative opioid consumption in patients who undergo surgery due to spine related pain a danish nationwide cohort study","src":["aau","au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"http://www.scopus.com/inward/record.url?scp=105004888299&partnerID=8YFLogxK","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-822378","identifier":[{"id":"40247626","type":"pmid"},{"id":"105004888299","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-88c4ad56-bccb-4f94-a8c9-61be0071121a","au-bdc2d5e5-a96d-4cb2-9431-51e28634a68a"],"keyword":["disc herniation","lumbar spine surgery","opioid","prolonged opioid use","spinal stenosis","spondylolisthesis"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-