,"All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-NP","DI-NP-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Gubra","Non-Profit Organisations","Private Research","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-4b1e86dc-8ca0-4b96-a3e1-f61ecf99c13b"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Pellino 3 E3 ligase promotes starvation-induced autophagy to prevent hepatic steatosis","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-799432","year":"2025","yearsub":"2025"}
{"abstract":"The aim of this review was to evaluate the comparative efficacy of intravitreal anti-vascular endothelial growth factor (anti-VEGF) therapy for neovascular AMD. We searched 12 literature databases for randomised clinical trials (RCT) on anti-VEGF therapy for neovascular AMD and extracted data on: change from baseline to 12 months in best-corrected visual acuity (BCVA) and central retinal thickness (CRT), and cumulative number of injections at 12 months. The reference for comparison was monthly ranibizumab. Comparisons were made using network meta-analyses. Forty-nine RCTs including 23 257 eyes of 23 257 patients were included. No anti-VEGF drug or treatment regimen provided a better BCVA response compared to the reference. For CRT, small but statistically significant improvements over the reference were observed for brolucizumab 3 mg (−27.9 μm) or 6 mg (−38.1 μm) in loading dose (LD) then every 8–12 weeks, aflibercept 8 mg in LD then every 12 (−26.9 μm) or 16 weeks (−32.1 μm), faricimab 6 mg in LD then treat-and-extend (−18.1 μm) and aflibercept 2 mg in LD then every 8 weeks (−11.3 μm). For the cumulative number of injections, a range of anti-VEGF drugs and treatment regimens provided a statistically significant and clinically meaningful reduction compared to the reference. When results are considered simultaneously, faricimab 6.0 mg or aflibercept 8.0 mg in a treatment regimen with an LD followed by either a treat-and-extend regimen or a fixed 12- or 16-week regimen appears to provide the optimal balance between visual outcomes, anatomical outcomes and the lowest treatment burden. However, studies of the long-term efficacy of newer anti-VEGF drugs are warranted.","author_count":18,"contributors":["Butler, Emilie T.S.","Arnold-Vangsted, Andreas","Schou, Marianne G.","Anguita, Rodrigo","Bjerager, Jakob","Borrelli, Enrico","Cehofski, Lasse Jørgensen","Ferro Desideri, Lorenzo","van Dijk, Elon H.C.","Faber, Carsten","Grauslund, Jakob","Hajari, Javad N.","Huemer, Josef","Klefter, Oliver N.","Krogh Nielsen, Marie","Sabaner, M. Cem","Schneider, Miklos","Subhi, Yousif"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-823788"],"filters":{"added":"2025-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, Middle East","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD","Oceania"],"corresponding_author":["Subhi, Yousif"],"country":["Australia","Austria","Hungary","Italy","Netherlands","Norway","Switzerland","Turkey","United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Azienda Ospedaliera - Universitaria Città della Salute e della Scienza di Torino","Kastamonu University","Kepler University Hospital","Leiden University Medical Center","Lions Eye Institute","Moorfields Eye Hospital NHS Foundation Trust","Semmelweis University","Sir Charles Gairdner Hospital","Training-Research Hospital Kastamonu","University Hospital Bern","University of Bern","University of Turin","Vestfold Hospital Trust"],"keyword":["Age related macular degeneration","Anti VEGF","Efficacy","Network Meta Analysis","macular neovascularization"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-SDR","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-AAU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"comparative efficacy of intravitreal anti vegf therapy for neovascular age related macular degeneration a systematic review with network meta analysis","src":["aau"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU"],"type":"djr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/aos.17506","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-823788","identifier":[{"id":"105002634435","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["aau-9647b950-f9a9-40e2-92d0-12bc60d2a4b2"],"keyword":["age-related macular degeneration","anti-VEGF","efficacy","macular neovascularization","network meta-analysis"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-B1711152F0EF47BAA6261DE05B676541"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND 4.0","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/aos.17506","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Rigshospitalet, Copenhagen University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"region of southern denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-SDR","l3nl":"Region of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"Region of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Region of Southern Denmark","namevar":["Odense University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-SDR","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"ch","key":"university of bern","loc":["Switzerland","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Bern","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"gb","key":"moorfields eye hospital nhs foundation trust","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Moorfields Eye Hospital NHS Foundation Trust","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"ch","key":"university hospital bern","loc":["Switzerland","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University Hospital Bern","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"it","key":"azienda ospedaliera universitaria città della salute e della scienza di torino","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Azienda Ospedaliera - Universitaria Città della Salute e della Scienza di Torino","used":1},{"affno":"7","country":"it","key":"university of turin","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Turin","used":1},{"affno":"8","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg