{"author_count":1,"contributors":["Jørgensen, Carsten René"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-152663"],"filters":{"added":"2023-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"skam i spændingsfeltet mellem moralsk kompas og psykisk lidelse","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-152663","ids":["au-28a3f3cb-6b52-4cf8-9e93-96f8837a3bbe"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-98F83B3A2A373C332617D128314B84B9"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus BSS, Department of Psychology and Behavioural Sciences"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Carsten René","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"3763a4db-6ce1-4e54-ac67-524a9604e1ce","name":"Jørgensen, Carsten René","orcid":"0000-0002-7324-1628","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"eisbn":["9788702399714"],"isbn":["9788702327809"],"pages":"443","place":"København","publisher":"Hans Reitzels Forlag","status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-28a3f3cb-6b52-4cf8-9e93-96f8837a3bbe"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Skam : i spændingsfeltet mellem moralsk kompas og psykisk lidelse","type":"Book","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-152663","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Enhver vare, der passerer et lands eller en toldunions grænse, undergives toldbehandling, under hvilken det blandt andet fastslås, hvor meget told, der skal betales af varerne. Det er beskatningselementerne, der afgør toldbelastningen af varerne. Beskatningselementerne består af varernes toldværdi, tariferingen samt varernes toldmæssige oprindelse.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Jørgensen, Carsten Willemoes","Kjær, Line"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-708245"],"filters":{"added":"2024-02","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["EU ret","Legalitet","Oprindelsesregler","WTO"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"iagttager kommissionens oprindelsesforordning legalitetsprincippet","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-708245","ids":["au-7dd89479-64c1-4192-80c4-396663d89e5f"],"keyword":["EU-ret","Legalitet","Oprindelsesregler","WTO"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-0D15EB15DDE1C1D3EF4FF0FF4E907DA0"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus BSS, Department of Law"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Carsten Willemoes","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"69969451-0c6e-42f9-bbbc-ee6c03b2464f","name":"Jørgensen, Carsten Willemoes","orcid":"0000-0001-5880-7294","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Line","key":"kjærpau","last":"Kjær","name":"Kjær, Line","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issn":["00346918"],"issue":"1","journal":"Revision & Regnskabsvaesen","pages":"44-53","paperid":"RR.1.2023.44","publisher":"Forlaget Thomson AS","publisher_org":"Forlaget Thomson A/S","status":"p","title":"Revision & Regnskabsvaesen","volume":"2023"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-7dd89479-64c1-4192-80c4-396663d89e5f"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Iagttager Kommissionens oprindelsesforordning legalitetsprincippet?","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-708245","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Oncogene-induced senescence (OIS) is a persistent anti-proliferative response that acts as a barrier against malignant transformation. During OIS, cells undergo dynamic remodeling, which involves alterations in protein and organelle homeostasis through autophagy. Here, we show that ribosomes are selectively targeted for degradation by autophagy during OIS. By characterizing senescence-dependent alterations in the ribosomal interactome, we find that the deubiquitinase USP10 dissociates from the ribosome during the transition to OIS. This release of USP10 leads to an enhanced ribosome ubiquitination, particularly of small subunit proteins, including lysine 275 on RPS2. Both reinforcement of the USP10-ribosome interaction and mutation of RPS2 K275 abrogate ribosomal delivery to lysosomes without affecting bulk autophagy. We show that the selective recruitment of ubiquitinated ribosomes to autophagosomes is mediated by the p62 receptor. While ribophagy is not required for the establishment of senescence per se, it contributes to senescence-related metabolome alterations and facilitates the senescence-associated secretory phenotype.","author_count":17,"contributors":["López, Aida Rodríguez","Jørgensen, Maria H.","Havelund, Jesper F.","Arendrup, Frederic S.","Kolapalli, Srinivasa Prasad","Nielsen, Thorbjørn M.","Pais, Eva","Beese, Carsten Jörn","Abdul-Al, Ahmad","Vind, Anna Constance","Bartek, Jiri","Bekker-Jensen, Simon","Montes, Marta","Galanos, Panagiotis","Faergeman, Nils","Happonen, Lotta","Frankel, Lisa B."],"cuid":["S02-100.00-704561"],"filters":{"added":"2023-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Frankel, Lisa B."],"country":["Sweden"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Karolinska Institute","Karolinska Institutet","Lund University"],"keyword":["Autophagy","CP Cell biology","CP Molecular biology","Oncogene induced senescence","Ribosomes","Selective autophagy","USP10","Ubiquitin"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-NP","DI-U"],"level3":{"NP":["DI-NP-ALL","DI-NP-CAN"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-NP-CAN","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"autophagy mediated control of ribosome homeostasis in oncogene induced senescence","src":["ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC-ND","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.celrep.2023.113381","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["The global proteome analysis was performed by the Proteomics Research Infrastructure ( PRI ) at the University of Copenhagen (UCPH), supported by the Novo Nordisk Foundation (NNF) ( NNF19SA0059305 ). We acknowledge support from the Swedish National Infrastructure for Biological Mass Spectrometry and the Core Facility for Integrated Microscopy , Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences , University of Copenhagen . The study was additionally supported by the INTEGRA mass spectrometry research infrastructure for proteomics and metabolomics established at SDU by a generous grant from the Novo Nordisk Foundation ( NNF20OC0061575 ). Work in the Frankel lab was supported by the Lundbeck Foundation ( R272-2017-3872 ), the Novo Nordisk Foundation ( NNF19OC0057772 and NNF22OC0079880 ), the Danish Cancer Society ( R269-A15420 and R209-A13011_001 ), and Dansk Kræftforskningsfond ( DKF-2020-75 - (476) ). Work in the Bekker-Jensen lab was supported by the European Research Council (ERC) under the European Union’s Horizon 2020 research and innovation program (grant agreement 863911 - PHYRIST). P.G. was supported by the Lundbeck Foundation ( R322-2019-2577 ). The global proteome analysis was performed by the Proteomics Research Infrastructure (PRI) at the University of Copenhagen (UCPH), supported by the Novo Nordisk Foundation (NNF) (NNF19SA0059305). We acknowledge support from the Swedish National Infrastructure for Biological Mass Spectrometry and the Core Facility for Integrated Microscopy, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, University of Copenhagen. The study was additionally supported by the INTEGRA mass spectrometry research infrastructure for proteomics and metabolomics established at SDU by a generous grant from the Novo Nordisk Foundation (NNF20OC0061575). Work in the Frankel lab was supported by the Lundbeck Foundation (R272-2017-3872), the Novo Nordisk Foundation (NNF19OC0057772 and NNF22OC0079880), the Danish Cancer Society (R269-A15420 and R209-A13011_001), and Dansk Kræftforskningsfond (DKF-2020-75 - (476)). Work in the Bekker-Jensen lab was supported by the European Research Council (ERC) under the European Union's Horizon 2020 research and innovation program (grant agreement 863911 - PHYRIST). P.G. was supported by the Lundbeck Foundation (R322-2019-2577). L.B.F. and A.R.L. developed the study concept and methodology. A.R.L. M.H.J. A.A.A. T.M.N. C.J.B. S.P.K. P.G. E.P. F.S.F. M.M. and A.C.V. performed experiments, established methodology, and analyzed data. J.H. and N.F. conducted the metabolomics analysis. A.R.L. and L.H. performed and analyzed the LC-MS/MS ribosome interactome data. S.B.-J. J.B. L.H. N.F. and L.B.F. supervised experiments and analysis. L.B.F. and A.R.L. wrote the manuscript. The authors declare no competing interests."],"id":"S02-100.00-704561","identifier":[{"id":"85175818246","type":"scopus"},{"id":"37930887","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["ku-414b15d9-d030-4f82-8196-dcf51d3de62a","sdu-087981f0-a301-4693-9c33-636d02270ee5"],"keyword":["CP: Cell biology","CP: Molecular biology","USP10","autophagy","oncogene-induced senescence","ribosomes","selective autophagy","ubiquitin"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-E471344BF42ADF4440AE1AB0E933B229"],"oa_link":[{"