arch?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-602974","year":"2023","yearsub":"2023"}
{"abstract":"Borderline personality disorder (BPD) is a severe and relatively prevalent psychiatric disorder, responsible for high rates of suicidal behaviors. Disturbed identity appears as at the very core of this disorder, being inter-related with all other BPD features. Notably, from a dimensional perspective on mental disorders, one should realize that it is from our usual self-representation that we live all our daily experiences. Then, if the understanding of self-concept (or identity) is impaired, all the interventions implemented to decrease the self's suffering will subsequently be impaired. The purpose of the present case study was to illustrate the nine identity diffusion categories described by Jørgensen & Bøye (2022) and how the level of identity function can be improved in a third-wave cognitive and behavioral therapy targeting progressive correct self-identification.","author_count":7,"contributors":["Ducasse, D","Brand-Arpon, V","Tralbaut, F","Ollivier, V","Courtet, P","Olié, E","Jørgensen, Carsten René"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-709700"],"filters":{"added":"2024-02","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Ducasse, D"],"country":["France"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Universite de Montpellier"],"keyword":["Behavior Therapy","Borderline Personality Disorder therapy","Humans","Self Concept","Suicidal Ideation"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"how to target disturbed identity in borderline patients self identification program a case study","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/85178500248","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-709700","identifier":[{"id":"36253170","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85178500248","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-ee59d47d-5379-4642-a5de-78ccdd6adea6"],"keyword":["Behavior Therapy","Borderline Personality Disorder/therapy","Humans","Self Concept","Suicidal Ideation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-B7A5C947C7D88519993A520DEA42346B"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"fr","key":"universite de montpellier","loc":["France","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Universite de Montpellier","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus BSS, Department of Psychology and Behavioural Sciences"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"D","key":"ducassepau","last":"Ducasse","name":"Ducasse, D","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"V","key":"brandarponpau","last":"Brand-Arpon","name":"Brand-Arpon, V","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"F","key":"tralbautpau","last":"Tralbaut","name":"Tralbaut, F","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"V","key":"ollivierpau","last":"Ollivier","name":"Ollivier, V","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"P","key":"courtetpau","last":"Courtet","name":"Courtet, P","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"E","key":"oliépau","last":"Olié","name":"Olié, E","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"cou