{"abstract":"Cells in the tumor microenvironment of Follicular lymphoma (FL) express checkpoint molecules such as programmed death ligands 1 and 2 (PD-L1 and PD-L2) and are suppressing anti-tumor immune activity. Stimulation of peripheral blood mononuclear cells (PBMC) with PD-L1 (IO103) or PD-L2 (IO120) peptides can activate specific T cells inducing anti-regulatory functions including cytotoxicity against PD-L1/PD-L2-expressing cells. In this study, we vaccinated eight FL patients with PD-L1 and PD-L2 peptides following treatment with standard chemotherapy. Patients experienced grade 1–2 injection site reaction (5/8) and mild flu-like symptoms (6/8). One patient experienced neutropenia and thrombocytopenia during pseudo-progression. Enzyme-linked immunospot detected vaccine-specific immune responses in PBMC from all patients, predominately toward PD-L1. The circulating immune composition was stable during treatment; however, we observed a reduction regulatory T cells, however, not significant. One patient achieved a complete remission during vaccination and two patients had pseudo-progression followed by long-term disease regression. Further examination of these early signs of clinical efficacy of the dual-epitope vaccine in a larger study is warranted.","author_count":19,"contributors":["Klausen, Uffe","Grønne Dahlager Jørgensen, Nicolai","Grauslund, Jacob Handlos","Munir Ahmad, Shamaila","Gang, Anne Ortved","Martinenaite, Evelina","Weis-Banke, Stine Emilie","Breinholt, Marie Fredslund","Novotny, Guy Wayne","Kjeldsen, Julie Westerlin","Holmström, Morten Orebo","Pedersen, Lone Bredo","Poulsen, Christian Bjørn","Hansen, Per Boye","Met, Özcan","Svane, Inge Marie","Niemann, Carsten Utoft","Pedersen, Lars Møller","Andersen, Mads Hald"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-532780"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Anti Tregs","Anti regulatory T cells","Follicular lymphoma","Immune modulatory vaccine","PD L1","PD L2"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-HO-ZEA","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"an immunogenic first in human immune modulatory vaccine with pd l000000000001 and pd l000000000002 peptides is feasible and shows early signs of efficacy in follicular lymphoma","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1080/2162402X.2021.1975889","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-532780","identifier":[{"id":"85115686622","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-e952365f-1be1-4447-9467-b742aa5fe5ed"],"keyword":["PD-l1","PD-l2","anti-regulatory T cells","anti-tregs","follicular lymphoma","immune modulatory vaccine"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-67BB691A2BAA9AE4530953C9B36ED440"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1080/2162402X.2021.1975889","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY-NC","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/281156292/2162402X.2021.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2021","yearSub":"2021"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Immunology and Microbiology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Rigshospitalet"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"region zealand","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-ZEA","l3nl":"Region Zealand","l3nn":"Region Zealand","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Region Zealand","namevar":["Zealand University Hospital - Roskilde"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-ZEA","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Uffe","key":"klausenuffepau","last":"Klausen","locid":"70d65017-9b5a-4e0d-8cdc-b2fe94229db4","name":"Klausen, Uffe","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Nicolai","key":"grønnedahlagerjørgensennicolaipau","last":"Grønne Dahlager Jørgensen","name":"Grønne Dahlager Jørgensen, Nicolai","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jacob Handlos","key":"grauslundjacobhandlospau","last":"Grauslund","locid":"f37e6723-6aba-40dd-a4b4-4a5fd2ae8c6d","name":"Grauslund, Jacob Handlos","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Shamaila","key":"munirahmadshamailapau","last":"Munir Ahmad","name":"Munir Ahmad, Shamaila","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Anne Ortved","key":"ganganneortvedpau","last":"Gang","locid":"d6439cff-57cd-406d-b6be-940a96f64f8f","name":"Gang, Anne Ortved","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Evelina","key":"martinenaiteevelinapau","last":"Martinenaite","name":"Martinenaite, Evelina","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Stine Emilie","key":"weisbankestineemiliepau","last":"Weis-Banke","locid":"b3831a09-be1f-4b59-960f-0bb397b028bc","name":"Weis-Banke, Stine Emilie","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Marie Fredslund","key":"breinholtmariefredslundpau","last":"Breinholt","name":"Breinholt, Marie Fredslund","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Guy Wayne","key":"novotnyguywaynepau","last":"Novotny","name":"Novotny, Guy Wayne","rank":9,"rol