37","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lene Meldgaard","key":"knudsenlenemeldgaardpau","last":"Knudsen","name":"Knudsen, Lene Meldgaard","rank":15,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2 1","first":"Mads Hald","key":"andersenmadshaldpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"f6dda437-480e-4d5e-b0a3-3287c9d2372a","name":"Andersen, Mads Hald","orcid":"0000-0002-2914-9605","rank":16,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["33240282"],"pub":{"doi":"10.3389/fimmu.2020.595035","issn":["16643224"],"journal":"Frontiers in Immunology","paperid":"595035","publisher":"Frontiers Media SA","publisher_org":"Frontiers Media S.A.","status":"p","title":"Frontiers in Immunology","volume":"11"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85096586862"],"sdg":["3. Good Health and Well-being","All UN SDG Classification"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-fe6880ec-5231-4034-bf46-89330bcb1135","ku-70c3c34d-a14f-4305-aafe-bfcda0e3feb3"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Peptide Vaccination Against PD-L1 With IO103 a Novel Immune Modulatory Vaccine in Multiple Myeloma : A Phase I First-in-Human Trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-099.82-038219","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
{"abstract":"Infections have become the major cause of morbidity and mortality among patients with chronic lymphocytic leukemia (CLL) due to immune dysfunction and cytotoxic CLL treatment. Yet, predictive models for infection are missing. In this work, we develop the CLL Treatment-Infection Model (CLL-TIM) that identifies patients at risk of infection or CLL treatment within 2 years of diagnosis as validated on both internal and external cohorts. CLL-TIM is an ensemble algorithm composed of 28 machine learning algorithms based on data from 4,149 patients with CLL. The model is capable of dealing with heterogeneous data, including the high rates of missing data to be expected in the real-world setting, with a precision of 72% and a recall of 75%. To address concerns regarding the use of complex machine learning algorithms in the clinic, for each patient with CLL, CLL-TIM provides explainable predictions through uncertainty estimates and personalized risk factors.","author_count":20,"contributors":["Agius, Rudi","Brieghel, Christian","Andersen, Michael A.","Pearson, Alexander T.","Ledergerber, Bruno","Cozzi-Lepri, Alessandro","Louzoun, Yoram","Andersen, Christen L.","Bergstedt, Jacob","von Stemann, Jakob H.","Jørgensen, Mette","Tang, Man Hung Eric","Fontes, Magnus","Bahlo, Jasmin","Herling, Carmen D.","Hallek, Michael","Lundgren, Jens","MacPherson, Cameron Ross","Larsen, Jan","Niemann, Carsten U."],"cuid":["S02-100.00-037443"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["America, North","Asia, Middle East","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Niemann, Carsten U."],"country":["France","Germany","Israel","Switzerland","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Bar-Ilan University","Institut Pasteur Paris","The University of Chicago","University College London","University of Cologne","University of Zurich"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"machine learning can identify newly diagnosed patients with cll at high risk of infection","src":["dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"CC BY","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-019-14225-8","version":"Published Version"},"funding_acknowledgement":["This work is in part supported by funding from the Novo Nordisk Foundation, grant NNF16OC0019302 and the Danish National Research Foundation grant 126. This work was initiated during a Modeling Immune System and Pathogen Camp (MispCamp). The authors thank the Danish hematology centers that participated with data submission to the Danish National CLL Registry. The following physicians contributed to data collection and represent the Danish Hematology centers participating in the Danish National CLL Registry: Christian Hartmann Geisler, Lisbeth Enggaard, Christian Bjørn Poulsen, Peter de Nully Brown, Henrik Frederiksen, Olav Jonas Bergmann, Elisa Jacobsen Pulczynski, Robert Schou Pedersen, Ilse Christiansen, and Linda Højberg Nielsen. C.N. has received consultancy fees and/or travel grants from Janssen, Abbvie, Novartis, Roche, Gilead, Sunesis, Acerta, AstraZeneca, and CSL Behring, research support from Abbvie, AstraZeneca, and Janssen, outside this project. C.D.H. received research funding and travel support from Roche. The other authors declare no competing interests."],"id":"S02-100.00-037443","identifier":[{"id":"000514638400003","type":"wos"},{"id":"31953409","type":"pmid"},{"id":"85078064654","type":"scopus"},{"id":"PMC6969150","type":"pmcid"}],"ids":["dtu-d6bf1e73-d73b-4cae-9ab5-4207a34fdaf9","ku-3a0c7cce-b22f-4aa3-bc08-6daaf00db261"],"lang":"English","