{"abstract":"Dette kompendium indeholder inputs til råmaterialer og tilgængelige materialer, der er klar til brug. Når man taler bæredygtighed, spiller alle mekanismer en rolle, lige fra hvilke materialer, hvor de kommer fra, hvordan kom de til fabrikken, til hvordan håndterer fabrikken dem mv.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Jørgensen, Poul-Erik","Paarmann, Eva","Bang, Anne Louise","Mølbæk, Anders Klitgaard","Høeg, Carsten Juncher","Toft, Karen"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-657532"],"filters":{"added":"2023-08","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Bæredygtighed","Materialer"],"level":"edu","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-UC"],"level3":{"OT":["Karen Toft"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-VIA"]},"level3all":["DI-UC-VIA"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"materialer amp bæredygtighed","src":["via"],"src-code":["DI-UC-VIA"],"type":"dln","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://ldcluster.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2020/11/Rapport-Materialer-og-b%C3%A6redygtighed-komprimeret.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-657532","ids":["via-5ddf2e91-7439-48ce-9ad5-c44e4e28eccb"],"keyword":["bæredygtighed","materialer"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Educational","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-EF495DBC2E6A737E6B462E97CE73C9CD"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://ldcluster.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2020/11/Rapport-Materialer-og-b%C3%A6redygtighed-komprimeret.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"via university college","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-VIA","l3nl":"VIA University College","l3nn":"VIA University College","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"VIA University College","namevar":["VIA, Forskning og udvikling, Forsk.center Kreative erhverv og professioner","VIA, Forskning og udvikling, Forskningsområde for teknologi og e