{"abstract":"Bogens fokus er retsreglerne, særligt EU-reglerne, der er umiddelbart anvendelige i Danmark. To områder er fundet særligt interessante og relevante; Reglerne vedrørende beskatningselementerne (toldens beskatningsbase) og toldskylden (pligten til at betale told). Begge områder er stort set uafhængig af overgangsreglerne, og har derfor kunne behandles mere dybtgående.","author_count":1,"contributors":["Jørgensen, Carsten Willemoes"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-223724"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Eksport","Import","Oprindelse","Toldret"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"toldret","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"db","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-223724","ids":["au-a59c6212-9c41-437b-b46e-5b8d8295089d"],"keyword":["Beskatningselementer","Eksport","Import","Oprindelse","Toldret","Toldværdi"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-57B81DB17AB704850B4F6715EA50638E"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus BSS, Department of Law"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Carsten Willemoes","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"69969451-0c6e-42f9-bbbc-ee6c03b2464f","name":"Jørgensen, Carsten Willemoes","orcid":"0000-0001-5880-7294","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788757442564"],"pages":"400","place":"København","publisher":"Djøf Forlag","status":"p"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affilia