63-7","status":"p","title":"Obesity Surgery","volume":"26"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84965019179"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-e4cbeb61-e5f9-472f-a19f-63a25f6ebf90"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"No Islet Cell Hyperfunction, but Altered Gut-Islet Regulation and Postprandial Hypoglycemia in Glucose-Tolerant Patients 3 Years After Gastric Bypass Surgery","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-530036","year":"2016","yearsub":"2016"}
