{"abstract":"Zealand Pharma has invented a glucagon analogue, ZP-GA-1, with increased stability in liquid formulation for treatment of hypoglycemia. A pharmacodynamic (PD) model is needed to compare ZP-GA-1 with marketed glucagon. We aim to develop a model of the complex glucose-insulin-glucagon dynamics based on physiology and data.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Wendt, Sabrina Lyngbye","Boye Knudsen, Carsten","Jørgensen, John Bagterp","Madsen, Henrik","Haidar, Ahmad"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-329483"],"event":{"end":"2016-02-06","place":"Milan, it","start":"2016-02-03","title":"9th International Conference on Advanced Technol​ogies and Treatments for Diabetes (ATTD 2016)","year":"2016"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","OECD"],"country":["Canada"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","McGill University"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-ZEA"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-ZEA","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"modelling the glucose insulin glucagon dynamics after subcutaneous administration of native glucagon and a novel glucagon analogue in dogs","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dco","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/120922244/poster_attd2016_slw_final_paper.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-329483","ids":["dtu-53d1edd3-8bc6-4d8d-af0a-3fb68eed5658"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-540AAD59E679849ED7507C1260F85F88"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/120922244/poster_attd2016_slw_final_paper.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://post-congress.dasterminal.com/attd201