{"abstract":"Når import-, eksport og speditionsvirksomheder ser frem mod 1. maj 2016, hvor den nye EU-toldkodeks skal anvendes, rejser der sig en lang række spørgsmål. Hvad ændres? Hvad forsvinder? Kommer der nye ordninger eller procedurer? Er der nye betingelser eller krav der skal opfyldes?","author_count":1,"contributors":["Jørgensen, Carsten Willemoes"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-144984"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"eu toldkodeksen i dansk kontekst","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"http://www.dasp.dk/sites/dasp.dk/files/speditionsret_-_nr_46_oktober_2015.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-144984","ids":["au-1b4b2e83-6fa3-48a2-8e01-22013a368986"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-F777A71E1C18D88290E48F17A10F8C4E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"http://www.dasp.dk/sites/dasp.dk/files/speditionsret_-_nr_46_oktober_2015.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus BSS, Department of Law"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Carsten Willemoes","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"69969451-0c6e-42f9-bbbc-ee6c03b2464f","name":"Jørgensen, Carsten Willemoes","orcid":"0000-0001-5880-7294","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"issue":"46","journal