{"abstract":"The design of electrically large antennas can be a significant challenge for computational electromagnetics (CEM) tools, particularly during the final stages of the design process where there are strict requirements for the accuracy. In the present paper, we consider the use of a newly developed accelerated Physical Optics (Fast-PO) and show that this approach allows for a timely and accurate solution of realistic designs. Several examples, ranging from canonical tests of the scaling of the method against the wavelength to real-life applications, illustrate the performance of the approach in practice.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Borries, Oscar Peter","Viskum, Hans-Henrik","Meincke, Peter","Jørgensen, Erik","Hansen, Per Christian","Schmidt, Carsten H."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-359867"],"event":{"acronym":"EuCAP","end":"2015-04-17","place":"Lisbon, pt","start":"2015-04-12","title":"9th European Conference on Antennas and Propagation","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["Airbus Operations GmbH","All Global Affiliations"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-TIC"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-TIC","DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"analysis of electrically large antennas using fast physical optics","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84949656008","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-359867","identifier":[{"id":"84949656008","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-b8f089a7-87d2-4ee3-bfcd-6ee7f760c68a"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-2-C4FC51124B2C740D7EF10A3E1E8F0ED8"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Applied Mathematics and Computer Science, Scientific Computing"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"ticra","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-TIC","l3nl":"TICRA","l3nn":"TICRA","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"TICRA","namevar":["TICRA"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-TIC","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"de","key":"airbus operations gmbh","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Airbus Operations GmbH","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Oscar Peter","key":"borriespau","last":"Borries","locid":"07ed5fe0-b447-49a9-9fb9-5555c76d072d","name":"Borries, Oscar Peter","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Hans-Henrik","key":"viskumpau","last":"Viskum","name":"Viskum, Hans-Henrik","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Peter","key":"meinckepau","last":"Meincke","name":"Meincke, Peter","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Erik","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","name":"Jørgensen, Erik","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Per Christian","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"6c6c6f32-e3b2-40d5-a407-aa8e2f051f7b","name":"Hansen, Per Christian","orcid":"0000-0002-7333-7216","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Carsten H.","key":"schmidtpau","last":"Schmidt","name":"Schmidt, Carsten H.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788890701856"],"pages":"1-5","publisher":"IEEE","status":"p","title":"Proceedings of the 9th European Conference on Antennas and Propagation (EuCAP 2015)"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84949656008"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Private Research","TICRA","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-b8f089a7-87d2-4ee3-bfcd-6ee7f760c68a"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Analysis of Electrically Large Antennas using Fast Physical Optics","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-359867","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Lack of activity during hospitalization may contribute to functional decline. The purpose of this study was to investigate (1) the time spent walking during hospitalization by geriatric patients referred to physical and/or occupational therapy and (2) the development in time spent walking during hospitalization. In this observational study, 24-hr accelerometer data (ActivPal) were collected from inclusion to discharge in 124 patients at an acute geriatric ward. The median time spent walking was 7 min per day. During the first quartile of hospitalization, the patients spent 4 (IQR:1;11) min per day walking, increasing to 10 (IQR:1;29) min during the last quartile. Improvement in time spent walking was primarily observed in the group able to perform the Timed Up & Go task at admission. When walking only 7 min per day, patients could be classified as inactive and at risk for functional decline; nonetheless, the physical activity level increased significantly during hospitalization.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Villumsen, Morten","Jørgensen, Martin Grønbech","Andreasen, Jane","Rathleff, Michael Skovdal","Mølgaard, Carsten"],"cuid":["S02-100.00-007744"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Physiotherapy"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U","DI-UC"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-NDR"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL"],"UC":["DI-UC-ALL","DI-UC-UCN"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-NDR","DI-U-AAU","DI-UC-UCN"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"very low levels of physical activity in older patients during hospitalization at an acute geriatric ward a prospective cohort study","src":["aau","ucn"],"src-code":["DI-U-AAU","DI-UC-UCN"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84946066069","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-007744","identifier":[{"id":"84946066069","type":"scopus"},{"id":"WOS:000365151500006","type":"wos"},{"id":"25415513","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["aau-9ff81cfe-6f73-448c-b40d-88793b4ea9f8","ucn-efaa3e1a-987e-4200-8a24-c1014d27ec88"],"keyword":["physiotherapy"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-2BA830FFCE6EEC19BED0C6B93C62FAA9"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Health Science and Technology","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Health Science and Technology, Center for Sensory-Motor Interaction","Aalborg University, The Faculty of Medicine, Department of Health Science and Technology, Physical Activity and Human Performance"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"north denmark region","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-NDR","l3nl":"North Denmark Region","l3nn":"North Denmark Region","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"North Denmark Region","namevar":["Aalborg Universitetshospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-NDR","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"ucn university college of northern denmark","l2":"DI-UC","l2n":"University Colleges","l3":"DI-UC-UCN","l3nl":"University College of Northern Denmark","l3nn":"UCN University College of Northern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"UCN University College of Northern Denmark","namevar":["Professionshøjskolen UCN, UCN Direktion, UCN Velfærd, Fysioterapeutuddannelsen"],"nora_code":"DI-UC-UCN","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","fi