{"abstract":"Roux-en-Y gastric bypass surgery (RYGB) in patients with type 2 diabetes often leads to early disease remission, and it is unknown to what extent this involves improved pancreatic β-cell function per se and/or enhanced insulin- and non-insulin-mediated glucose disposal (glucose effectiveness). We studied 30 obese patients, including 10 with type 2 diabetes, 8 with impaired glucose tolerance and 12 with normal glucose tolerance, before, 1 week and 3 months after RYGB, using an intravenous glucose tolerance test to estimate first-phase insulin response, insulin sensitivity (Si) and glucose effectiveness with Bergman's minimal model. In the fasting state, insulin sensitivity was estimated by HOMA-S and β-cell function by HOMA-β. Moreover, mixed meal tests and OGTTs were performed. In patients with type 2 diabetes, glucose levels normalized after RYGB, first-phase insulin secretion in response to iv glucose increased two-fold and HOMA-β improved already 1 week postoperatively, with further enhancements at 3 months. Insulin sensitivity increased in the liver (HOMA-S) at 1 week and at 3 months in peripheral tissues (Si), whereas glucose effectiveness did not improve significantly. During oral testing, GLP-1 responses and insulin secretion increased regardless of glucose tolerance. Therefore, in addition to increased insulin sensitivity and exaggerated postprandial GLP-1 levels, diabetes remission after RYGB involves early improvement of pancreatic β-cell function per se, reflected in enhanced first-phase insulin secretion to iv glucose and increased HOMA-β. A major role for improved glucose effectiveness after RYGB was not supported by this study.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Martinussen, Christoffer","Bojsen-Moller, Kirstine N","Dirksen, Carsten","Jacobsen, Siv H","Jørgensen, Nils B","Kristiansen, Viggo B","Holst, Jens Juul","Madsbad, Sten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-399025"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"immediate enhancement of first phase insulin secretion and unchanged glucose effectiveness in patients with type 000000000002 diabetes after roux en y gastric bypass","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-399025","identifier":[{"id":"25628424","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84930897612","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-094a09e8-8cde-4477-983b-e07fc9e23e8a"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-2A932963000A985910F9076044D417B5"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Christoffer","key":"martinussenpau","last":"Martinussen","name":"Martinussen, Christoffer","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Kirstine N","key":"bojsenmollerpau","last":"Bojsen-Moller","name":"Bojsen-Moller, Kirstine N","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Carsten","key":"dirksenpau","last":"Dirksen","name":"Dirksen, Carsten","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Siv H","key":"jacobsenpau","last":"Jacobsen","locid":"9258b6d4-2bc2-4170-93e9-56b995a9601d","name":"Jacobsen, Siv H","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Nils B","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"694893d0-af33-4f21-ad66-945a1522de37","name":"Jørgensen, Nils B","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Viggo B","key":"kristiansenpau","last":"Kristiansen","locid":"fc94f8a0-2390-4d4d-a587-a079c4ad34c5","name":"Kristiansen, Viggo B","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jens Juul","key":"holstpau","last":"Holst","locid":"864b6401-9024-4773-9bdb-f4d4ca57dcad","name":"Holst, Jens Juul","orcid":"0000-0001-6853-3805","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Sten","key":"madsbadpau","last":"Madsbad","locid":"1018c708-245a-4057-9263-074578042385","name":"Madsbad, Sten","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["25628424"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1152/ajpendo.00506.2014","issn":["01931849","15221555"],"issn_org":["01931849"],"issue":"6","journal":"American Journal of Physiology: Endocrinology and Metabolism","status":"p","title":"American Journal of Physiology: Endocrinology and Metabolism","volume":"308"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84930897612"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-094a09e8-8cde-4477-983b-e07fc9e23e8a"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Immediate enhancement of first-phase insulin secretion and unchanged glucose effectiveness in patients with type 2 diabetes after Roux-en-Y gastric bypass","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-399025","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Innovation og entreprenørskab er på den nationale dagorden, også når det gælder universitetsuddannelserne. Universiteterne skal sikre et højt fagligt niveau hos de studerende, og samtidig skal universiteterne bidrage til at øge innovationskapaciteten i samfundet. Undervisere og studerende skal i større udstrækning bidrage til værdiskabelse til gavn for hele samfundet gennem bedre integrationen mellem undervisning, forskning og innovation. Vi står med en klar udfordring, og innovations- og entreprenørskabspædagogikken kan være en del af løsningen. Innovationspædagogikken handler om at bringe innovationsprocessen ind i en fagdisciplinær kontekst hvor den studerende, gennem at arbejde med sin egen faglighed, udvikler sit blik for og evnen til at skabe værdi gennem at sætte sin egen faglige viden i spil. Således kan innovation og entreprenørskab skabe rammerne for at koble de videnskabelige discipliners kernefaglighed til løsningen af påtrængende samfundsmæssige problemer.","author_count":4,"contributors":["Jørgensen, Claus Bøttcher","Hjortsø, Carsten Nico Portefée"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-497926"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Bioteknologi","Designtænkning","Effectuation entrepreneurship teaching","Forretningsmodeller","IPR","Innovation","Innovation and Entrepreneurship Education"],"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"at åbne de lukkede undervisnings rum innovationspædagogik entreprenørskabsundervisning","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-497926","ids":["ku-aef52656-20b0-4ab0-8f5b-66268dfa5739"],"keyword":["Bioteknologi","Designtænkning","Effectuation, entrepreneurship, teaching","Forretningsmodeller","IPR","Innovation","Innovation and Entrepreneurship Education","Innovations pædagogik"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-F29F5835A5AC122D6E18F4B58FB94AFC"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Veterinary Clinical Sciences, Animal Genetics, Bioinformatics and Breeding","Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Veterinary Clinical Sciences, IKVH Animal Genetics, Bioinformatics, and breeding"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Claus Bøttcher","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"365a5ab1-03de-4c96-a89c-854788846aa0","name":"Jørgensen, Claus Bøttcher","orcid":"0000-0003-4749-5306","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Carsten Nico Portefée","key":"hjortsøpau","last":"Hjortsø","locid":"10dc45b5-742f-4a66-82ae-3eb9a254844d","name":"Hjortsø, Carsten Nico Portefée","orcid":"0000-0002-2365-8740","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Lotte","key":"rieneckerpedh","last":"Rienecker","name":"Rienecker, Lotte","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Peter","key":"strayjørgensenpedh","last":"Stray Jørgensen","name":"Stray Jørgensen, Peter","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"eisbn":["9788759324035"],"isbn":["9788759321379"],"pages":"101-120","publisher":"Samfundslitteratur","status":"p","title":"Universitetspædagogiske praksisser"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-aef52656-20b0-4ab0-8f5b-66268dfa5739"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"At åbne de lukkede undervisnings­rum : innovationspædagogik/entreprenørskabsundervisning","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-497926","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"During 2006 and 2008 two bottom trawl surveys were conducted at East Greenland to 72°N covering depths down to 1500 m. In the 149 trawl hauls in total 113 fish species were recorded of which 37 were considered pelagic and excluded from the analyses. As a first step the abundance data for the 76 benthic species were used for analyses of the fish fauna diversity and fish assemblages. Nine assemblages were found by a standard type of cluster analysis. A Bayesian multinomial logit model was then applied to calculate vectors of probabilities defining the likelihood of each haul belonging to each of the nine clusters. By means of a geostatistical tool the spatial distribution of the conditional probabilities for each cluster (assemblage) was mapped. Each of the nine assemblages was further defined by indicator species, depth and temperature. The assemblages were well defined regarding geographical distribution, species composition, temperature and depth. Three of the assemblages were located in the cold Iceland Sea while six were found in the somewhat warmer Irminger Sea","author_count":3,"contributors":["Jørgensen, Ole A","Hvingel, Carsten","Møller, P.R."],"cuid":["S02-100.00-036527"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"country":["Norway"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Institute of Marine Research"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"bottom fish assemblages at the shelf and continental slope off east greenland","src":["dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.2960/J.v47.m706","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-100.00-036527","identifier":[{"id":"84944894672","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-adc899a5-dc04-472b-a0b1-3388666c414a","ku-60538d71-e193-40de-a864-c2b944d82ab4"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-28F4C2423C87CF39FAE3AC14C65EFE09"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"rem","url":"http://journal.nafo.int/dnn/Portals/0/Vol47-2015/3_J47-Jorgensen-706.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.2960/J.v47.m706","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"loc","url":"https://curis.ku.dk/ws/files/161942862/J47_2015_book_web.pdf","version":"Published Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/118542335/Publishers_version.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Institute of Aquatic Resources","Technical University of Denmark, National Institute of Aquatic Resources, Section for Ecosystem based Marine Management"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"no","key":"institute of marine research","loc":["Norway","Europe, Non-EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Institute of Marine Research","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, The Natural History Museum, Natural History Museum of Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Ole A","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"9a30404c-3cb3-423c-95b4-734ab573fe95","name":"Jørgensen, Ole A","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Carsten","key":"hvingelpau","last":"Hvingel","name":"Hvingel, Carsten","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Peter Rask","key":"møllerpau","last":"Møller","locid":"4947afc1-cc18-4c51-8250-e5a783136c03","name":"Møller, Peter Rask","orcid":"0000-0002-0177-0977","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.2960/j.v47.m706","issn":["02506408","18131859"],"issn_org":["02506408"],"journal":"Journal of Northwest Atlantic Fishery Science","pages":"37-55","publisher":"Northwest Atlantic Fisheries Organization","status":"p","title":"Journal of Northwest Atlantic Fishery Science","volume":"47"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84944894672"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-adc899a5-dc04-472b-a0b1-3388666c414a","ku-60538d71-e193-40de-a864-c2b944d82ab4"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Bottom fish assemblages at the shelf and continental slope off East Greenland","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-100.00-036527","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
