urant","name":"Durant, Neal D.","rank":21,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Philip John","key":"binningpau","last":"Binning","locid":"e66bafa7-c98f-4309-b1b0-8356b7009e55","name":"Binning, Philip John","orcid":"0000-0002-6731-1861","rank":22,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Poul Løgstrup","key":"bjergpau","last":"Bjerg","locid":"c06e1108-55d2-4602-bac0-d7c020b40374","name":"Bjerg, Poul Løgstrup","orcid":"0000-0002-1977-1871","rank":23,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","All Hospitals","All Private Research","All Universities","COWI A/S","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Governmental Institutions","Hospitals","NIRAS A/S","Private Research","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","WSP Danmark A/S"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-ed4f2dfe-ed1d-40ab-b55b-62ab158ef951"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Site characterization and in-situ remediation in fractured geologic media contaminated by chlorinated solvents","type":"Conference Abstract","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-375563","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Roux-en-Y gastric bypass (RYGB) improves glycemic control within days after surgery, and changes in insulin sensitivity and beta-cell function are likely to be involved. We studied 10 obese patients with type 2 diabetes and 10 obese glucose tolerant subjects before, 1 week, 3 months and 1 year after RYGB. Participants were included after a preoperative diet induced total weight loss of -9.2±1.2%. Hepatic and peripheral insulin sensitivity were assessed using the hyperinsulinemic euglycemic clamp combined with glucose tracer technique and beta-cell function evaluated in response to an intravenous glucose-glucagon challenge as well as an oral glucose load. Already within 1 week, RYGB reduced basal glucose production, improved basal hepatic insulin sensitivity and increased insulin clearance highlighting the liver as an important organ responsible for the early effects on glucose metabolism after surgery. Insulin mediated glucose disposal and suppression of fatty acids did not improve immediately after surgery but increased at 3 months and 1 year likely related to the reduction in body weight. Insulin secretion increased after RYGB, but only in patients with type 2 diabetes and only in response to oral glucose, underscoring the importance of the changed gut anatomy.","author_count":15,"contributors":["Bojsen-Møller, Kirstine N","Dirksen, Carsten","Jørgensen, Nils B","Jacobsen, Siv H","Serup, Annette Karen Lundbeck","Albers, Peter Hjorth","Hansen, Dorte L","Worm, Dorte","Naver, Lars","Kristiansen, Viggo B","Wojtaszewski, Jørgen","Kiens, Bente","Holst, Jens Juul","Richter, Erik A.","Madsbad, Sten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-401571"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"early enhancements of hepatic and later of peripheral insulin sensitivity combined with increased postprandial insulin secretion contribute to improved glycemic control after roux en y gastric bypass","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.2337/db13-1307","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-401571","identifier":[{"id":"24241533","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84899062151","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-0da717e3-af25-4724-a63e-b8ebcbec5281"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-383119969D92C009C8E7015C035A3E9C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.2337/db13-1307","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital - Amager and Hvidovre"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Biomedical Sciences, Teaching"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Kirstine N","key":"bojsenmøllerpau","last":"Bojsen-Møller","name":"Bojsen-Møller, Kirstine N","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Carsten","key":"dirksenpau","last":"Dirksen","name":"Dirksen, Carsten","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Nils Bruun","key":"jørgensenpau","las