{"abstract":"Hłjesteret har ved dom af 13/8 2014, TI’S 2014, 694, fastslået, at der i Danmark skal opkræves importmoms af DVD-disketter sendt fra Danmark til Belgien under forsendelsesordningen, i en situation hvor forsendelsen i toldmæssig henseende ikke blev afsluttet i overensstemmelse med reglerne. Konsekvensen af Hłjesterets dom er, at Danmark får adgang til momsindtægter, som baseret på de i dommen anfłrte faktuelle oplysninger efter forfatternes vurdering tilkommer Belgien.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Kjær, Line","Jørgensen, Carsten Willemoes"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-179613"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Told","Toldret"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"en stat på vildspor","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-179613","ids":["au-582a49a6-88d4-46f5-8147-83302c83da87"],"keyword":["Importmoms","Told","Toldret"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-D1E2B014AA32106C58512FEA0A157CFE"],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Social Science (SOC)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus BSS, Department of Law"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","use