{"author_count":6,"contributors":["Jørgensen, Carsten René","Freund, Charlotte","Bøye, Rikke","Jordet, Henning","Andersen, Diane","Kjølbye, Morten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-242012"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"outcome of mentalization based and supportive psychotherapy in patients with borderline personality disorders a randomized trial","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1600-0447.2012.01923.x","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-242012","identifier":[{"id":"84874982669","type":"scopus"},{"id":"22897123","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-c5620c8f-54b9-4c19-89b8-8e7e3343cf1d"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-8256ECBCA77AA4B51D757E07E729FF93"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1600-0447.2012.01923.x","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Social Science (SOC)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus BSS, Department of Psychology and Behavioural Sciences","Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - The Department of General Psychiatry"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Carsten René","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"3763a4db-6ce1-4e54-ac67-524a9604e1ce","name":"Jørgensen, Carsten René","orcid":"0000-0002-7324-1628","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Charlotte","key":"freundpau","last":"Freund","locid":"a37705f0-054b-4170-b240-eeaa5ae55034","name":"Freund, Charlotte","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Rikke","key":"bøyepau","last":"Bøye","locid":"c816211a-6dc5-4594-ba92-a5d3aa050cde","name":"Bøye, Rikke","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henning","key":"jordetpau","last":"Jordet","locid":"4c5b8fcf-f449-4259-b436-1ad295559195","name":"Jordet, Henning","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Diane","key":"andersenpau","last":"Andersen","locid":"e4683136-5943-4baa-9526-090509206c37","name":"Andersen, Diane","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Morten","key":"kjølbyepau","last":"Kjølbye","locid":"ee83f57f-449f-409a-a16a-47ea46248ec6","name":"Kjølbye, Morten","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["22897123"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1111/j.1600-0447.2012.01923.x","issn":["0001690X","16000447"],"issn_org":["0001690X"],"issue":"4","journal":"Acta Psychiatrica Scandinavica","pages":"305-17","publisher":"John Wiley & Sons Inc.","status":"p","title":"Acta Psychiatrica Scandinavica","volume":"127"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84874982669"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-c5620c8f-54b9-4c19-89b8-8e7e3343cf1d"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Outcome of mentalization-based and supportive psychotherapy in patients with borderline personality disorders: a randomized trial","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-242012","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"AIMS/HYPOTHESIS: Roux-en-Y gastric bypass surgery (RYGB) improves glucose tolerance in patients with type 2 diabetes, but also changes the glucose profile in response to a meal in glucose-tolerant individuals. We hypothesised that the driving force for the changed postprandial glucose profiles after RYGB is rapid entry of glucose into the systemic circulation due to modified gastrointestinal anatomy, causing hypersecretion of insulin and other hormones influencing glucose disappearance and endogenous glucose production. METHODS: We determined glucose absorption and metabolism and the rate of lipolysis before and 3 months after RYGB in obese glucose-tolerant individuals using the double-tracer technique during a mixed meal. RESULTS: After RYGB, the postprandial plasma glucose profile changed, with a higher peak glucose concentration followed by a faster return to lower than basal levels. These changes were brought about by changes in glucose kinetics: (1) a more rapid appearance of ingested glucose in the systemic circulation, and a concomitant increase in insulin and glucagon-like peptide-1 secretion; (2) postprandial glucose disappearance was maintained at a high rate for a longer time after RYGB. Endogenous glucose production was similar before and after surgery. Postoperative glucagon secretion increased and showed a biphasic response after RYGB. Adipose tissue basal rate of lipolysis was higher after RYGB. CONCLUSIONS/INTERPRETATION: A rapid rate of absorption of ingested glucose into the systemic circulation, followed by increased insulin secretion and glucose disappearance appears to drive the changes in the glucose profile observed after RYGB, while endogenous glucose production remains unchanged. TRIAL REGISTRATION: ClinicalTrials.gov NCT01559792. FUNDING: The study was part of the UNIK program: Food, Fitness & Pharma for Health and Disease (see www.foodfitnesspharma.ku.dk ). Funding was received from the Novo Nordisk foundation and the Strategic Research Counsel for the Capital Area and Danish Research Agency. The primary investigator received a PhD scholarship from the University of Copenhagen, which was one-third funded by Novo Nordisk.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Jacobsen, Siv H","Bojsen-Møller, Kirstine N","Dirksen, Carsten","Jørgensen, Nils B","Clausen, Trine R","Wulff, Birgitte S","Kristiansen, Viggo B","Worm, Dorte","Hansen, Dorte Lindqvist","Holst, Jens Juul","van Hall, Gerrit","Madsbad, Sten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-430603"],"filters":{"added":"2022-04","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Absorptiometry Photon","Body Mass Index","Female","Gastric Bypass","Glucose","Humans","Male"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"effects of gastric bypass surgery on glucose absorption and metabolism during a mixed meal in glucose tolerant individuals","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00125-013-3003-0","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-430603","identifier":[{"id":"23893303","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84890126414","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-3e32ffc2-13a3-4584-a702-34423ec0e3ce"],"keyword":["Absorptiometry, Photon","Body Mass Index","Female","Gastric Bypass","Glucose","Humans","Male"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-C01CA3D802653D58EC7B96BF7ACA11A5"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00125-013-3003-0","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","first":"Siv H","key":"jacobsenpau","last":"Jacobsen","locid":"9258b6d4-2bc2-4170-93e9-56b995a9601d","name":"Jacobsen, Siv H","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Kirstine N","key":"bojsenmøllerpau","last":"Bojsen-Møller","name":"Bojsen-Møller, Kirstine N","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Carsten","key":"dirksenpau","last":"Dirksen","name":"Dirksen, Carsten","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Nils B","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"694893d0-af33-4f21-ad66-945a1522de37","name":"Jørgensen, Nils B","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Trine R","key":"clausenpau","last":"Clausen","name":"Clausen, Trine R","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Birgitte S","key":"wulffpau","last":"Wulff","name":"Wulff, Birgitte S","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Viggo B","key":"kristiansenpau","last":"Kristiansen","locid":"fc94f8a0-2390-4d4d-a587-a079c4ad34c5","name":"Kristiansen, Viggo B","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Dorte","key":"wormpau","last":"Worm","locid":"e9a01598-3ada-4289-9c00-a8ddb8fe62f0","name":"Worm, Dorte","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Dorte L","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","locid":"f3e33a09-3b30-42fe-95a9-6b6c309d3b79","name":"Hansen, Dorte Lindqvist","name_org":"Hansen, Dorte L","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Jens Juul","key":"holstpau","last":"Holst","locid":"864b6401-9024-4773-9bdb-f4d4ca57dcad","name":"Holst, Jens Juul","orcid":"0000-0001-6853-3805","rank":10,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Gerrit","key":"vanhallpau","last":"van Hall","locid":"55a9b111-6dbb-4a42-a9ab-d5f3785fbdae","name":"van Hall, Gerrit","orcid":"0000-0002-2519-8127","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Sten","key":"madsbadpau","last":"Madsbad","locid":"1018c708-245a-4057-9263-074578042385","name":"Madsbad, Sten","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["23893303"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/s00125-013-3003-0","issn":["0012186X","14320428"],"issn_org":["0012186X"],"issue":"10","journal":"Diabetologia","pages":"2250-4","status":"p","title":"Diabetologia","volume":"56"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84890126414"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-3e32ffc2-13a3-4584-a702-34423ec0e3ce"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Effects of gastric bypass surgery on glucose absorption and metabolism during a mixed meal in glucose-tolerant individuals","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-430603","year":"2013","yearsub":"2014"}
{"abstract":"Context:Roux-en-Y gastric bypass (RYGB) improves glucose tolerance and ameliorates fasting hyperinsulinemia within days after surgery. Improvements in hepatic insulin sensitivity and insulin clearance could contribute importantly to these effects.Objective:The objective of the investigation was to study changes in insulin clearance after RYGB.Design:This was a prospective study of fasting hepatic insulin clearance and, in a subgroup of patients, postprandial insulin clearance after a meal test before and 1 week, 3 months, and 1 year after RYGB.Setting:The study was conducted at Hvidovre Hospital (Hvidovre, Denmark).Patients:Patients included 2 groups of obese RYGB-patients: 1) type 2 diabetes (T2D) group: 32 patients with T2D (meal test, n = 13), 2) normal glucose tolerance (NGT) group: 32 patients with NGT (meal test, n = 12).Intervention:The intervention was RYGB.Main Outcome Measure:Fasting hepatic insulin clearance (fasting C-peptide/fasting insulin). Postprandial insulin clearance (incremental areas under the curve of insulin secretion rates/incremental areas under the curve of insulin).Results:Fasting hepatic insulin clearance increased after 1 week (P <.01) and further at 3 months (P <.01), remaining elevated 1 year postoperatively (P <.01) with no difference between the T2D and NGT groups. Postprandial insulin clearance changed only in the T2D group with an increase at 1 week (P <.01) that was maintained at 3 months (P = .06) and 1 year (P <.01).Conclusions:RYGB increases insulin clearance within 1 week after surgery, highlighting the liver as a key organ involved in the early beneficial effect on glucose metabolism. Postprandial insulin secretion may be underestimated postoperatively in patients with type 2 diabetes when evaluated by peripheral insulin concentrations instead of insulin secretion rates or C-peptide.","author_count":10,"contributors":["Bojsen-Møller, Kirstine N","Dirksen, Carsten","Jørgensen, Nils B","Jacobsen, Siv H","Hansen, Dorte Lindqvist","Worm, Dorte","Naver, Lars","Kristiansen, Viggo B","Holst, Jens Juul","Madsbad, Sten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-536845"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"increased hepatic insulin clearance after roux en y gastric bypass","src":["ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1210/jc.2013-1286","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-536845","identifier":[{"id":"23609835","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84878475020","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["ku-f05140dc-6fe1-47c5-8997-ae541b5452bd"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-0D06B18DA86C66B8F6C7E6E215BF336B"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1210/jc.2013-1286","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Biomedical Sciences, Teaching"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"","first":"Kirstine N","key":"bojsenmøllerpau","last":"Bojsen-Møller","name":"Bojsen-Møller, Kirstine N","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Carsten","key":"dirksenpau","last":"Dirksen","name":"Dirksen, Carsten","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","first":"Nils B","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"694893d0-af33-4f21-ad66-945a1522de37","name":"Jørgensen,