","last":"Møller","locid":"5db09d5d-dbed-4d96-a000-a1681016491c","name":"Møller, Arne","rank":11,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Aage Kristian Olsen","key":"alstruppau","last":"Alstrup","locid":"fa66f5b8-0468-4e85-b570-969776c5ebde","name":"Alstrup, Aage Kristian Olsen","orcid":"0000-0002-0084-9122","rank":12,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Leif","key":"østergaardpau","last":"Østergaard","locid":"af45ec8c-f95a-4937-9e48-ffabe2b8933d","name":"Østergaard, Leif","orcid":"0000-0003-2930-6997","rank":13,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Carsten Reidies","key":"bjarkampau","last":"Bjarkam","locid":"a1770adc-a79f-434a-98bc-02e64ffd13cd","name":"Bjarkam, Carsten Reidies","rank":14,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["21867797"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1016/b978-0-444-53815-4.00014-5","issn":["00796123","18757855"],"issn_org":["00796123"],"journal":"Progress in Brain Research","pages":"97-103","publisher":"Elsevier BV","publisher_org":"Elsevier B.V.","status":"p","title":"Progress in Brain Research","volume":"194"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-80051887844"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-e4f7b18d-8e9a-40d3-8753-063785ae611f"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Development of neuromodulation treatments in a large animal model : Do neurosurgeons dream of electric pigs?","type":"Journal Review","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-260067","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"Practical oil reservoir management involves solution of large-scale constrained optimal control problems. In this paper we present a numerical method for solution of large-scale constrained optimal control problems. The method is a single-shooting method that computes the gradients using the adjoint method. We use an Explicit Singly Diagonally Implicit Runge-Kutta (ESDIRK) method for the integration and a quasi-Newton Sequential Quadratic Programming (SQP) algorithm for the constrained optimization. We use this algorithm in a numerical case study to optimize the production of oil from an oil reservoir using water ooding and smart well technology. Compared to the uncontrolled case, the optimal operation increases the Net Present Value of the oil field by 10%.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Völcker, Carsten","Jørgensen, John Bagterp","Stenby, Erling Halfdan"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-361400"],"event":{"end":"2011-12-15","place":"Orlando, Florida, us","start":"2011-12-12","title":"50th IEEE Conference on Decision and Control and European Control Conference","year":"2011"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"oil reservoir production optimization using optimal control","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/7661747/Oil_res_2011.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-361400","identifier":[{"id":"84860654307","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-be442121-00a5-4bfe-a9f5-a4a6eb110967"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-F093F60AFD4536CF111A3DB316496222"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://backend.orbit.dtu.dk/ws/files/7661747/Oil_res_2011.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/CDC.2011.6161271","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Informatics and Mathematical Modeling"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Carsten","key":"völckerpau","last":"Völcker","locid":"c3f83288-e76c-48d8-bb93-cedc1ae0d972","name":"Völcker, Carsten","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"John Bagterp","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"d2bc6de4-a5c6-43f7-8712-606bd02a88e9","name":"Jørgensen, John Bagterp","orcid":"0000-0001-9799-2808","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Erling Halfdan","key":"stenbypau","last":"Stenby","locid":"08d1917e-6211-4ea5-8ac3-7959d122b86a","name":"Stenby, Erling Halfdan","orcid":"0000-0002-2296-069X","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/cdc.2011.6161271","issn":["07431546"],"journal":"IEEE Conference on Decision and Control. Proceedings","pages":"7937-7943","publisher":"Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers Inc.","status":"p","title":"IEEE Conference on Decision and Control. Proceedings","title_org":"I E E E Conference on Decision and Control. Proceedings"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84860654307"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Technical University of Denmark","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-be442121-00a5-4bfe-a9f5-a4a6eb110967"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark"],"title":"Oil Reservoir Productio