{"author_count":4,"contributors":["Pries-Heje, Jan","Olsen, Linda"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-558022"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-OTH"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-PR-OTH","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"coping with multi sourcing decisions a case study from danske bank","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/34394269/Pries_Heje_Olsen_2011_Coping_with_multi_sourcing_decisions.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-558022","ids":["ruc-1e18b83c-8bbf-4a51-b994-744837820272"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-86650D7E1325F7D81A19B39D22E95AFF"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/34394269/Pries_Heje_Olsen_2011_Coping_with_multi_sourcing_decisions.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of People and Technology, User-Driven IT Innovation","Roskilde University, The Department of Communication, Business and Information Technologies"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"other companies","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-OTH","l3nl":"Other Companies","l3nn":"Other Companies","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Other Companies","namevar":["Danske Bank"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-OTH","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","first":"Jan","key":"prieshejepau","last":"Pries-Heje","locid":"6dbca1cc-ed5b-479e-be59-0cf0ae86a2a8","name":"Pries-Heje, Jan","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Linda","key":"olsenpau","last":"Olsen","name":"Olsen, Linda","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Morten","key":"hertzumpedh","last":"Hertzum","name":"Hertzum, Morten","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Carsten","key":"jørgensenpedh","last":"Jørgensen","name":"Jørgensen, Carsten","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9788251927581"],"pages":"213-230","place":"Trondheim, Norway","publisher":"TAPIR Akademisk Forlag","status":"p","subtitle":"balancing sourcing and innovation in information systems development","title":"SourceIT"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Private Research","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Other Companies","Private Research","Roskilde University","Universities","danske bank"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ruc-1e18b83c-8bbf-4a51-b994-744837820272"],"src":["RUC Roskilde University"],"title":"Coping with multi-sourcing decisions : A case study from Danske Bank","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-558022","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"Surface exchange of greenhouse gasses (GHG) between land/sea and the atmosphere is an important climate feedback mechanism. The processes involved in exchange of GHG needs to be fully understood and accurately quantified in order to increase reliability of climate projections and ensure that actions initiated to reduce anthropogenic GHG emissions are sustainable and not destructive to existing ecosystem services. Therefore it is important to address i.e. land use change in relation to the regulating services of the ecosystems, such as carbon sequestration and climate regulation. At present, the surface exchange of GHG in Denmark and Danish waters is unknown and qualified predictions of the effect of changes in climate or anthropogenic activities are not possible. In ECOCLIM it is a goal to quantify the natural sinks and sources controlling the atmospheric concentration of CO2 and CH4 thus a thorough understanding of the ecosystem processes controlling the uptake or emissions of GHG is fundamental. Here we present ECOCLIM in the context of ecosystem services and the experimental studies within ECOCLIM which will lead to an enhanced understanding of Danish ecosystems.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Sørensen, Lise Lotte","Boegh, Eva","Bendtsen, J","Dellwik, Ebba","Friborg, Thomas","Geels, Camilla","Hansen, Kristina","Ibrom, Andreas","T. Jørgensen, Eva","Sejr, Michael","Ambelas Skjøth, Carsten"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-558149"],"event":{"end":"2011-11-23","place":"Copenhagen, dk","start":"2011-11-21","title":"CRES Annual Meeting 2011","year":"2011"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Ecosystem service","Greenhouse gas exchange","Modelling"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-RUC"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"ecosystem services in ecoclim","src":["ruc"],"src-code":["DI-U-RUC"],"type":"dca","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/34922003/abstracts2011_3.pdf","version":"Pre-print"},"id":"S01-000.00-558149","ids":["ruc-2010d42f-5a09-4951-974e-1a9d20ea16ff"],"keyword":["ECOCLIM","atmospheric sea flux","ecosystem service","greenhouse gas exchange","modelling"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-F728741940A9C89B77163A3E822530FA"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://rucforsk.ruc.dk/ws/files/34922003/abstracts2011_3.pdf","version":"Pre-print"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ruc roskilde university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-RUC","l3nl":"Roskilde University","l3nn":"RUC Roskilde University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"RUC Roskilde University","namevar":["Roskilde University, Department of Science and Environment, Environmental Dynamics","Roskilde University, The Department of Environmental, Social and Spatial Change"],"nora_code":"DI-U-RUC","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"dk","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn