nd Metabolism","status":"p","title":"American Journal of Physiology: Endocrinology and Metabolism","volume":"301"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-80053270813"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["ku-46d51fe4-0d94-49e4-8fe6-74512f003dde"],"src":["KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Bed rest reduces metabolic protein content and abolishes exercise-induced mRNA responses in human skeletal muscle","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-435722","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"author_count":6,"contributors":["Wulff, Carsten","Høg, Mads Andersen","Holm-Petersen, Kirsten","Hansen, Carsten","Jørgensen, Trine","Gregersen, Ole"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-664994"],"filters":{"added":"2022-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"level":"pop","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-GV"],"level3":{"GV":["DI-GV-ALL","DI-GV-VIVE"]},"level3all":["DI-GV-VIVE"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"social forskning 000000002011 000000000004","src":["vive"],"src-code":["DI-GV-VIVE"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.vive.dk/ws/files/2508396/sf_2011_4.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-664994","ids":["vive-ce60bf11-8b2c-4ecb-88d4-9d9acb9c4f8c"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-0213E0FFED7703521793DD332C216AD9"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.vive.dk/ws/files/2508396/sf_2011_4.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"vive the danish center for social science research","l2":"DI-GV","l2n":"Governmental Institutions","l3":"DI-GV-VIVE","l3nn":"VIVE The Danish Center for Social Science Research","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"VIVE The Danish Center for Social Science Research","namevar":["VIVE - The Danish Center for Social Science Research, VIVE Kommunikation"],"nora_code":"DI-GV-VIVE","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Carsten","key":"wulffpau","last":"Wulff","locid":"cd62074e-697c-4c07-b82c-af85d394b325","name":"Wulff, Carsten","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Mads Andersen","key":"høgpau","last":"Høg","locid":"d4447e99-9e72-4c23-acab-8da444b90914","name":"Høg, Mads Andersen","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Kirsten","key":"holmpetersenpau","last":"Holm-Petersen","name":"Holm-Petersen, Kirsten","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Carsten","key":"hansenpau","last":"Hansen","name":"Hansen, Carsten","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Trine","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","locid":"4b417f79-c334-4856-8b9f-711c8d0a15cb","name":"Jørgensen, Trine","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Ole","key":"gregersenpau","last":"Gregersen","locid":"03728315-4e96-494a-b391-a0e86121abf9","name":"Gregersen, Ole","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"publisher":"SFI - Det Nationale Forskningscenter for Velfærd","status":"p"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Governmental Institutions","DI-ALL","DI-GV","DI-GV-ALL","Governmental Institutions"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["vive-ce60bf11-8b2c-4ecb-88d4-9d9acb9c4f8c"],"src":["VIVE The Danish Center for Social Science Research"],"title":"Social Forskning, 2011:4","type":"Other-Internet Publication","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-664994","year":"2011"}
{"abstract":"Literature on innovation emphasises the potential for organisations to collaborate and network instead of carrying out innovation individually. Integrating suppliers, customers and other organisations into the innovation process is perceived as a key to success in innovation management (Chesbrough, 2003). Furthermore, the management of the initial phase of the innovation process has proven vital to the overall innovation success (Kim and Wilemon, 2002a,b). Although the merits of network-based innovations are widely acknowledged, the managerial challenges of the initial integration of external organisations in an innovation network are somewhat neglected in the literature. The aim of this paper is hence to address the challenges that an organisation faces when integrating a plurality of suppliers, customers and other organisations into the Fuzzy Front End of the innovation process.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Jørgensen, Jacob","Bergenholtz, Carsten","Goduscheit, René Chester","Rasmussen, Erik Stavnsager"],"cuid":["S02-095.74-014033"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Collaboration","Fuzzy front end","Innovation management","Inter Firm","Inter Organisational"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-U"],"level3":{"OT":["Unspecified organisation"],"U":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AAU","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"managing inter firm collaboration in the fuzzy front end structure as a two edged sword","src":["au","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1142/S1363919611003118","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-095.74-014033","identifier":[{"id":"79952049977","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-13e2e7da-38a7-4078-9744-bc7c705efe2a","sdu-3ca4f13c-a7ed-4583-90fb-822889919721"],"keyword":["Innovation management","collaboration","fuzzy front-end","inter-firm","inter-organisational"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-AC380C5EF9359D826AC3E5EBF5E3AD58"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1142/S1363919611003118","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"aau aalborg university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AAU","l3nl":"Aalborg University","l3nn":"AAU Aalborg University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AAU Aalborg University","namevar":["Aalborg University (AAU)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AAU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Aarhus BSS, Aarhus School of Business, Centre for Organizational Renewal and Evolution (CORE)","Aarhus University, Aarhus BSS, Aarhus School of Business, Department of Management","Aarhus University, Aarhus BSS, Department of Management, Department of Business Administration - Management"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Business and Social Sciences","SDU, The Faculty of Business and Social Sciences, Department of Business & Management (DBM)","SDU, The Faculty of Business and Social Sciences, Department of Business & Management (DBM), Centre for Integrative Innovation Management"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"miscellaneous","l2":"DI-OT","l2n":"Miscellaneous","l3":"DI-OT","l3nl":"Other Research","l3nn":"Miscellaneous","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Miscellaneous","namevar":["Unspecified organisation"],"nora_code":"DI-OT","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Jacob","key":"jørgensenpau","last":"Jørgensen","name":"Jørgensen, Jacob","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Jacob","key":"højjørgensenpau","last":"Høj Jørgensen","name":"Høj Jørgensen, Jacob","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Carsten","key":"bergenholtzpau","last":"Bergenholtz","locid":"97d6003d-184b-49da-89f9-945f005ecef7","name":"Bergenholtz, Carsten","orcid":"0000-0002-6020-561X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 1","corresponding":null,"first":"René Chester","key":"goduscheitpau","last":"Goduscheit","locid":"f033d620-4f20-4d37-8231-dadbd0642b45","name":"Goduscheit, René Chester","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3 4","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Erik Stavnsager","key":"rasmussenpau","last":"Rasmussen","locid":"75db9f06-020a-47a0-a7e1-37fe7d28ee06","name":"Rasmussen, Erik Stavnsager","orcid":"0000-0002-2448-9838","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1142/s1363919611003118","issn":["13639196","17575877"],"issn_org":["13639196"],"issue":"1","journal":"International Journal of Innovation Management","pages":"145-163","publisher":"World Scientific Publishing Co. Pte Ltd","status":"p","title":"International Journal of Innovation Management","volume":"15"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-79952049977"],"search":{"DAF":["Aalborg University","Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Miscellaneous","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-OT","DI-OT-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Miscellaneous","Other Research","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-13e2e7da-38a7-4078-9744-bc7c705efe2a","sdu-3ca4f13c-a7ed-4583-90fb-822889919721"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Managing Inter-Firm Collaboration in the Fuzzy Front-End: Structure as a Two-Edged Sword","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-095.74-014033","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"OBJECTIVES: The primary aim of this study was to assess pregnant women's knowledge of first trimester combined Down's syndrome screening in a setting of required informed consent. Secondary, we wanted to identify relevant differences in knowledge level among subgroups of pregnant women, including subgroups informed in different ways about prenatal examinations. METHODS: Data stem from a population-based cross-sectional questionnaire study including 15 multiple-choice questions assessing knowledge of different screening aspects. Included were 6,427 first trimester pregnant women from three Danish obstetric departments offering prenatal screening free of charge. Both participants and non-participants in the screening programme were included. The results are based on 4,095 responders (64%). Differences between sub-groups were examined by chi-squared tests and logistic regression analysis. Estimates are stated with 95% CI. RESULTS: The majority of the participants (87.6% (86.6-88.6) to 92.6% (91.7-93.3)) correctly identified the test concept and the main condition being screened for. Fewer participants (16.4% (15.3-17.6) to 43.3% (41.8-44.8)) correctly recognised test accuracy and the potential risk of adverse findings other than Down's syndrome. Knowledge level was positively associated with length of education (adjusted ORs 1.0 (0.8-1.4) to 3.9 (2.4-6.4)) and participation in the screening programme (adjusted OR 0.9 (0.6-1.3) to 5.9 (3.9-8.8)). Participation in an individual information session was weakly associated with more knowledge. CONCLUSION: The majority of the pregnant women correctly identified the test concept and the main condition being screened for. The pregnant women were found less knowledgeable on test accuracy and drawbacks. Copyright © 2010 ISUOG. Published by John Wiley & Sons, Ltd.","author_count":14,"contributors":["Dahl, Katja","Hvidman, Lone","Jørgensen, Finn Stener","Henriques, Carsten","Olesen, Frede","Kjaergaard, Hanne","Kesmodel, Ulrik Schiøler","Kjaergaard, Hanne"],"cuid":["S03-092.69-013954"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":3,"keyword":["Knowledge","Prenatal diagnostics","Screening","Viden"],"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"first trimester down syndrome screening pregnant women s knowledge","src":["au","ku","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-KU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/uog.8839","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S03-092.69-013954","identifier":[{"id":"80051741347","type":"scopus"},{"id":"20878670","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-12fa3500-c10c-11df-8cb9-000ea68e967b","ku-9de31392-81da-4150-b62b-4aac2c9461e6","sdu-6de4f257-9e26-4e31-a261-f48cb620cff4"],"keyword":["Knowledge","Prenatal diagnostics","Prenatal diagnostik","Screening","Viden"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-2A1E86A741ED848177FC8CB1FED53902"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/uog.8839","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Department of Obstetrics and Gynaecology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Gynaecology and Obstetrics"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":3,"key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU"}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Katja","key":"dahlkatjapau","last":"Dahl","locid":"cd9a2038-d71c-4763-8962-904c0480c62d","name":"Dahl, Katja","orcid":"0009-0005-9164-9386","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"K","key":"dahlkpau","last":"Dahl","name":"Dahl, K","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Lone","key":"hvidmanlonepau","last":"Hvidman","locid":"775710ad-9044-41cb-839b-7aaa134d7e70","name":"Hvidman, Lone","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"L","key":"hvidmanlpau","last":"Hvidman","name":"Hvidman, L","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Finn Stener","key":"jørgensenfinnstenerpau","last":"Jørgensen","name":"Jørgensen, Finn Stener","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"FS","key":"jørgensenfspau","last":"Jørgensen","name":"Jørgensen, FS","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Carsten Ulrik","key":"henriquescarstenulrikpau","last":"Henriques","locid":"582f33ea-59a6-462b-84e2-e52339c84d2a","name":"Henriques, Carsten Ulrik","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Carsten","key":"henriquescarstenpau","last":"Henriques","name":"Henriques, Carsten","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Frede","key":"olesenfredepau","last":"Olesen","locid":"e11a7374-c3b0-468b-981f-5561f1f9842e","name":"Olesen, Frede","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"F","key":"olesenfpau","last":"Olesen","name":"Olesen, F","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Hanne","key":"kjærgaardhannepau","last":"Kjærgaard","name":"Kjærgaard, Hanne","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Hanne","key":"kjaergaardhannepau","last":"Kjaergaard","name":"Kjaergaard, Hanne","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"H","key":"kjaersgaardhpau","last":"Kjaersgaard","name":"Kjaersgaard, H","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ulrik Schiøler","key":"kesmodelulrikschiølerpau","last":"Kesmodel","locid":"81211407-89a5-4568-adf9-fbcf015f02e9","name":"Kesmodel, Ulrik Schiøler","orcid":"0000-0003-3868-106X","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["20878670"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1002/uog.8839","issn":["09607692","14690705"],"issn_org":["09607692"],"issue":"2","journal":"Ultrasound in Obstetrics & Gynecology","pages":"145-51","publisher":"John Wiley and Sons Ltd","status":"p","title":"Ultrasound in Obstetrics & Gynecology","volume":"38"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-80051741347"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Copenhagen","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-12fa3500-c10c-11df-8cb9-000ea68e967b","ku-9de31392-81da-4150-b62b-4aac2c9461e6","sdu-6de4f257-9e26-4e31-a261-f48cb620cff4"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","KU University of Copenhagen","SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"First-trimester Down syndrome screening : pregnant women's knowledge","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S03-092.69-013954","year":"2011","yearsub":"2011"}
{"abstract":"Artiklen gennemgår de regler, der gælder for grænsekontrol ved de indre grænser i EU. Reglerne for kontrol af hhv. personer, varer og transportmidler har udviklet sig meget forskelligt, men på alle områder har man arbejdet for en total afskaffelse af grænsekontrollen. Dette mål er i vidt omfang nået, selvom det varierer, hvor klare reglerne er. Den danske aftale om styrkelse af grænsekontrollen, som blev indgået i maj 2011, beskriver en kontrolindsats, der er i strid med både Schengen-reglerne og reglerne om varernes fri bevægelighed. Den senere udvikling i sagen peger i retning af en større opmærksomhed på de krav, som EU-retten stiller på dette område.","author_count":2,"contributors":["Jørgensen, Carsten Willemoes","Sørensen, Karsten Engsig"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-192253"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["EU ret","Grænsekontrol"],"level":"sci","mra":["soc"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"grænsekontrol ved eu s indre grænser","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.djoef.dk/blade/juristen.aspx","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-192253","ids":["au-6e45f2df-3821-4e35-ab37-d87ecde1127e"],"keyword":["EU-ret","Grænsekontrol"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Social Science"],"noi":["Local-1-1-82C2D3641CB5BDC1CA7C7F278AD98B79"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.djoef.dk/blade/juristen.aspx","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://www.statsbiblioteket.dk/au/showrecord.jsp?record_id=sb_4052852","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus Un